{"step_index":122,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-15T02:44:28Z","input_tokens":490,"cache_read_tokens":49984,"output_tokens":5276,"content":"Below are the complete source files for the **new project** (Bootstrap + React + React‑Router, GM role handling, Base64 export/import, and a simple map editor). All files are created in your artifact directory `C:\\Users\\jairo\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\b91b810e-928c-493c-ba7f-da11b9e7b0b1`.  \n\nYou can open any of them directly from the links.\n\n---\n\n### 1️⃣ Root HTML (already created)  \n📄 [index.html](file:///C:/Users/jairo/.gemini/antigravity/brain/b91b810e-928c-493c-ba7f-da11b9e7b0b1/index.html)\n\n---\n\n### 2️⃣ `src/App.jsx`\n\n📄 [src/App.jsx](file:///C:/Users/jairo/.gemini/antigravity/brain/b91b810e-928c-493c-ba7f-da11b9e7b0b1/src/App.jsx)\n\n```jsx\n/* src/App.jsx */\nimport { BrowserRouter as Router, Routes, Route, Navigate, useNavigate } from \"react-router-dom\";\nimport NavBar from \"./NavBar.jsx\";\nimport CharList from \"./CharList.jsx\";\nimport CharForm from \"./CharForm.jsx\";\nimport MapList from \"./MapList.jsx\";\nimport MapEditor from \"./MapEditor.jsx\";\nimport { loadChars, loadMaps, saveChars, saveMaps } from \"./utils/storage.js\";\nimport { decompress } from \"./utils/crypto.js\";\n\nfunction App() {\n  const [characters, setCharacters] = React.useState(loadChars());\n  const [maps, setMaps] = React.useState(loadMaps());\n  const [isGM, setIsGM] = React.useState(JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(\"isGM\")) ?? false);\n\n  // Persist data\n  React.useEffect(() => saveChars(characters), [characters]);\n  React.useEffect(() => saveMaps(maps), [maps]);\n  React.useEffect(() => localStorage.setItem(\"isGM\", JSON.stringify(isGM)), [isGM]);\n\n  // Load character from ?char=BASE64 on first load\n  React.useEffect(() => {\n    const params = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);\n    const b64 = params.get(\"char\");\n    if (b64) {\n      try {\n        const char = decompress(b64);\n        char.id = Date.now().toString();\n        setCharacters(prev => [...prev, char]);\n        // Clean URL\n        window.history.replaceState({}, document.title, window.location.pathname);\n      } catch (e) {\n        console.error(\"Invalid character link:\", e);\n      }\n    }\n  }, []);\n\n  return (\n    <Router>\n      <NavBar isGM={isGM} setIsGM={setIsGM} />\n      <div className=\"container py-3\">\n        <Routes>\n          <Route path=\"/\" element={<CharList chars={characters} setChars={setCharacters} isGM={isGM} />} />\n          <Route path=\"/char/new\" element={<CharForm onSave={c => setCharacters([...characters, c])} />} />\n          <Route path=\"/char/:id\" element={<CharForm chars={characters} setChars={setCharacters} />} />\n          <Route path=\"/maps\" element={<MapList maps={maps} setMaps={setMaps} />} />\n          <Route path=\"/mapedit/:id?\" element={<MapEditor maps={maps} setMaps={setMaps} />} />\n          <Route path=\"*\" element={<Navigate to=\"/\" replace />} />\n        </Routes>\n      </div>\n    </Router>\n  );\n}\n\n// Bootstrap the app\nReactDOM.createRoot(document.getElementById(\"root\")).render(<App />);\n```\n\n---\n\n### 3️⃣ `src/NavBar.jsx`\n\n📄 [src/NavBar.jsx](file:///C:/Users/jairo/.gemini/antigravity/brain/b91b810e-928c-493c-ba7f-da11b9e7b0b1/src/NavBar.jsx)\n\n```jsx\n/* src/NavBar.jsx */\nimport { Link, useNavigate } from \"react-router-dom\";\n\nexport default function NavBar({ isGM, setIsGM }) {\n  const navigate = useNavigate();\n\n  return (\n    <nav className=\"navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-dark bg-primary mb-3\">\n      <div className=\"container-fluid\">\n        <Link className=\"navbar-brand\" to=\"/\">Companion</Link>\n        <div className=\"collapse navbar-collapse\">\n          <ul className=\"navbar-nav me-auto mb-2 mb-lg-0\">\n            <li className=\"nav-item\"><Link className=\"nav-link\" to=\"/\">Personajes</Link></li>\n            <li className=\"nav-item\"><Link className=\"nav-link\" to=\"/maps\">Mapas</Link></li>\n            <li className=\"nav-item\">\n              <button className=\"nav-link btn btn-link\" onClick={() => navigate(\"/mapedit\")}>\n                Crear mapa\n              </button>\n            </li>\n          </ul>\n          <button\n            className={`btn btn-${isGM ? \"warning\" : \"secondary\"} ms-2`}\n            onClick={() => setIsGM(!isGM)}\n          >\n            {isGM ? \"GM activo\" : \"Modo jugador\"}\n          </button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </nav>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### 4️⃣ `src/CharList.jsx`\n\n📄 [src/CharList.jsx](file:///C:/Users/jairo/.gemini/antigravity/brain/b91b810e-928c-493c-ba7f-da11b9e7b0b1/src/CharList.jsx)\n\n```jsx\n/* src/CharList.jsx */\nimport { Link, useNavigate } from \"react-router-dom\";\nimport { compress } from \"./utils/crypto.js\";\n\nexport default function CharList({ chars, setChars, isGM }) {\n  const navigate = useNavigate();\n\n  const deleteChar = (c) => {\n    if (confirm(`¿Eliminar la ficha \"${c.name}\"?`)) {\n      setChars(prev => prev.filter(ch => ch.id !== c.id));\n    }\n  };\n\n  const shareLink = (c) => {\n    const b64 = compress(c, true); // hide secret\n    const link = `${window.location.origin}?char=${b64}`;\n    navigator.clipboard.writeText(link).then(() => alert(\"Enlace copiado\"));\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <div>\n      <h1>Mis fichas</h1>\n      <div className=\"d-flex mb-2\">\n        <button className=\"btn btn-success me-2\"\n          onClick={() => navigate(\"/char/new\")}>Crear nueva ficha</button>\n      </div>\n\n      {chars.length === 0 && <p>No hay fichas guardadas.</p>}\n\n      {chars.map(c => (\n        <div key={c.id} className=\"card mb-3 p-3\">\n          <h4>{c.name || \"Sin nombre\"}</h4>\n          <p><strong>Concepto:</strong> {c.concept}</p>\n          {c.portrait && <img src={c.portrait} alt=\"retrato\" className=\"img-thumbnail mb-2\" style={{maxHeight: \"150px\"}}/>}\n          <div className=\"d-flex flex-wrap\">\n            <button className=\"btn btn-primary me-2\"\n              onClick={() => navigate(`/char/${c.id}`)}>Editar</button>\n            {isGM && <button className=\"btn btn-danger me-2\"\n              onClick={() => deleteChar(c)}>Eliminar</button>}\n            <button className=\"btn btn-outline-primary me-2\"\n              onClick={() => shareLink(c)}>Compartir (link)</button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      ))}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### 5️⃣ `src/CharForm.jsx`\n\n📄 [src/CharForm.jsx](file:///C:/Users/jairo/.gemini/antigravity/brain/b91b810e-928c-493c-ba7f-da11b9e7b0b1/src/CharForm.jsx)\n\n```jsx\n/* src/CharForm.jsx */\nimport { useParams, useNavigate } from \"react-router-dom\";\n\nconst emptyChar = () => ({\n  id: Date.now().toString(),\n  name: \"\",\n  concept: \"\",\n  portrait: \"\",\n  attributes: { Fuerza: 0, Agilidad: 0, Intelecto: 0, Percepción: 0, Voluntad: 0 },\n  health: 100,\n  sanity: 100,\n  skills: [],\n  statuses: [],\n  inventory: \"\",\n  secret: \"\"\n});\n\nexport default function CharForm({ chars = [], setChars, onSave }) {\n  const { id } = useParams();\n  const navigate = useNavigate();\n  const editing = chars.find(c => c.id === id);\n  const [form, setForm] = React.useState(editing ?? emptyChar());\n\n  const handleChange = e => {\n    const { name, value, type, checked } = e.target;\n    setForm(prev => ({\n      ...prev,\n      [name]: type === \"checkbox\" ? checked : value\n    }));\n  };\n\n  const handleAttr = (attr, val) => {\n    setForm(prev => ({\n      ...prev,\n      attributes: { ...prev.attributes, [attr]: Number(val) }\n    }));\n  };\n\n  const addSkill = () => setForm(prev => ({\n    ...prev,\n    skills: [...prev.skills, { id: Date.now(), name: \"\", description: \"\" }]\n  }));\n\n  const updateSkill = (sid, field, value) => setForm(prev => ({\n    ...prev,\n    skills: prev.skills.map(sk => sk.id === sid ? { ...sk, [field]: value } : sk)\n  }));\n\n  const removeSkill = sid => setForm(prev => ({\n    ...prev,\n    skills: prev.skills.filter(sk => sk.id !== sid)\n  }));\n\n  const toggleStatus = st => setForm(prev => ({\n    ...prev,\n    statuses: prev.statuses.includes(st)\n      ? prev.statuses.filter(s => s !== st)\n      : [...prev.statuses, st]\n  }));\n\n  const submit = e => {\n    e.preventDefault();\n    onSave ? onSave(form) : setChars(prev => {\n      const exists = prev.some(c => c.id === form.id);\n      return exists ? prev.map(c => c.id === form.id ? form : c) : [...prev, form];\n    });\n    navigate(\"/\");\n  };\n\n  const STATUS_OPTIONS = [\"Envenenado\",\"Infectado\",\"Asustado\",\"Ablandado\",\"Cegado\"];\n\n  return (\n    <form className=\"card p-3\" onSubmit={submit}>\n      <h2>{editing ? \"Editar\" : \"Crear\"} ficha</h2>\n\n      <div className=\"mb-2\"><label className=\"form-label\">Nombre</label>\n        <input className=\"form-control\" name=\"name\" value={form.name} onChange={handleChange} required/>\n      </div>\n\n      <div className=\"mb-2\"><label className=\"form-label\">Concepto / Profesión</label>\n        <input className=\"form-control\" name=\"concept\" value={form.concept} onChange={handleChange}/>\n      </div>\n\n      <div className=\"mb-2\"><label className=\"form-label\">URL del retrato</label>\n        <input className=\"form-control\" name=\"portrait\" value={form.portrait} onChange={handleChange}/>\n      </div>\n      {form.portrait && <img src={form.portrait} alt=\"retrato\" className=\"img-thumbnail mb-2\"/>}\n\n      <fieldset className=\"mb-3\"><legend>Atributos</legend>\n        {Object.keys(form.attributes).map(attr => (\n          <div key={attr} className=\"d-flex align-items-center mb-2\">\n            <label className=\"me-2 flex-grow-1\">{attr}\n              <input type=\"number\" className=\"form-control ms-2\"\n                value={form.attributes[attr]}\n                onChange={e => handleAttr(attr, e.target.value)}/>\n            </label>\n            <button type=\"button\" className=\"btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm\"\n              onClick={() => alert(`Tirada de ${attr}: ${Math.floor(Math.random()*20)+1}`)}>\n              🎲\n            </button>\n          </div>\n        ))}\n      </fieldset>\n\n      <div className=\"d-flex align-items-center mb-2\">\n        <label className=\"me-2\">Vida</label>\n        <button type=\"button\" className=\"btn btn-outline-success btn-sm me-1\"\n          onClick={() => setForm(p => ({...p, health: p.health + 1}))}>+</button>\n        <span>{form.health}</span>\n        <button type=\"button\" className=\"btn btn-outline-danger btn-sm ms-1\"\n          onClick={() => setForm(p => ({...p, health: p.health - 1}))}>‑</button>\n      </div>\n\n      <div className=\"d-flex align-items-center mb-2\">\n        <label className=\"me-2\">Cordura</label>\n        <button type=\"button\" className=\"btn btn-outline-success btn-sm me-1\"\n          onClick={() => setForm(p => ({...p, sanity: p.sanity + 1}))}>+</button>\n        <span>{form.sanity}</span>\n        <button type=\"button\" className=\"btn btn-outline-danger btn-sm ms-1\"\n          onClick={() => setForm(p => ({...p, sanity: p.sanity - 1}))}>‑</button>\n      </div>\n\n      <section className=\"mb-3\"><h4>Cartas de Habilidad</h4>\n        {form.skills.map(sk => (\n          <div key={sk.id} className=\"border p-2 mb-2\">\n            <input className=\"form-control mb-1\" placeholder=\"Nombre\"\n              value={sk.name} onChange={e => updateSkill(sk.id, \"name\", e.target.value)}/>\n            <textarea className=\"form-control mb-1\" rows={2} placeholder=\"Descripción\"\n              value={sk.description}\n              onChange={e => updateSkill(sk.id, \"description\", e.target.value)}/>\n            <button type=\"button\" className=\"btn btn-danger btn-sm\"\n              onClick={() => removeSkill(sk.id)}>Eliminar</button>\n          </div>\n        ))}\n        <button type=\"button\" className=\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\" onClick={addSkill}>+ Añadir carta</button>\n      </section>\n\n      <section className=\"mb-3\"><h4>Estados</h4>\n        {STATUS_OPTIONS.map(st => (\n          <div className=\"form-check form-check-inline\" key={st}>\n            <input className=\"form-check-input\" type=\"checkbox\"\n              checked={form.statuses.includes(st)} onChange={() => toggleStatus(st)}/>\n            <label className=\"form-check-label\">{st}</label>\n          </div>\n        ))}\n      </section>\n\n      <div className=\"mb-2\"><label className=\"form-label\">Inventario</label>\n        <textarea className=\"form-control\" name=\"inventory\" rows={3}\n          value={form.inventory} onChange={handleChange}/>\n      </div>\n\n      <div className=\"mb-3\"><label className=\"form-label\">Notas secretas (solo GM)</label>\n        <textarea className=\"form-control\" name=\"secret\" rows={3}\n          value={form.secret} onChange={handleChange}/>\n      </div>\n\n      <div className=\"d-flex\">\n        <button type=\"submit\" className=\"btn btn-success me-2\">Guardar</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" className=\"btn btn-secondary\"\n          onClick={() => navigate(\"/\")}>Cancelar</button>\n      </div>\n    </form>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### 6️⃣ `src/MapList.jsx`\n\n📄 [src/MapList.jsx](file:///C:/Users/jairo/.gemini/antigravity/brain/b91b810e-928c-493c-ba7f-da11b9e7b0b1/src/MapList.jsx)\n\n```jsx\n/* src/MapList.jsx */\nimport { useNavigate } from \"react-router-dom\";\n\nexport default function MapList({ maps, setMaps }) {\n  const navigate = useNavigate();\n\n  const copyMap = (map) => {\n    const data = btoa(JSON.stringify(map));\n    navigator.clipboard.writeText(data).then(() => alert(\"Mapa copiado al portapapeles\"));\n  };\n\n  const deleteMap = (id) => {\n    if (confirm(\"¿Eliminar este mapa?\")) {\n      setMaps(prev => prev.filter(m => m.id !== id));\n    }\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <div>\n      <h1>Mis mapas</h1>\n      <div className=\"d-flex mb-2\">\n        <button className=\"btn btn-success me-2\" onClick={() => navigate(\"/mapedit\")}>Crear nuevo mapa</button>\n        <button className=\"btn btn-outline-primary\"\n          onClick={() => navigate(\"/mapedit/import\")}>Importar mapa</button>\n      </div>\n\n      {maps.length === 0 && <p>No hay mapas guardados.</p>}\n\n      {maps.map(m => (\n        <div key={m.id} className=\"card mb-3 p-3\">\n          <h4>{m.name || \"Mapa sin nombre\"}</h4>\n          <div className=\"d-flex\">\n            <button className=\"btn btn-primary me-2\"\n              onClick={() => navigate(`/mapedit/${m.id}`)}>Editar</button>\n            <button className=\"btn btn-danger me-2\"\n              onClick={() => deleteMap(m.id)}>Eliminar</button>\n            <button className=\"btn btn-outline-secondary\"\n              onClick={() => copyMap(m)}>Copiar (Base64)</button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      ))}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### 7️⃣ `src/MapEditor.jsx`\n\n📄 [src/MapEditor.jsx](file:///C:/Users/jairo/.gemini/antigravity/brain/b91b810e-928c-493c-ba7f-da11b9e7b0b1/src/MapEditor.jsx)\n\n```jsx\n/* src/MapEditor.jsx */\nimport { useParams, useNavigate } from \"react-router-dom\";\nimport { Stage, Layer, Rect } from \"react-konva\";\nimport Konva from \"konva\";\n\nexport default function MapEditor({ maps, setMaps }) {\n  const { id } = useParams();               // undefined → nuevo mapa\n  const navigate = useNavigate();\n  const editing = maps.find(m => m.id === id) || null;\n\n  const [name, setName] = React.useState(editing?.name ?? \"\");\n  const stageRef = React.useRef();\n\n  // Load existing map JSON (if any)\n  React.useEffect(() => {\n    if (editing && editing.json && stageRef.current) {\n      const loaded = Konva.Node.create(editing.json);\n      stageRef.current.destroyChildren();\n      stageRef.current.add(loaded);\n    }\n  }, [editing]);\n\n  const addRect = () => {\n    const layer = stageRef.current.findOne(\"Layer\");\n    const rect = new Konva.Rect({\n      x: 20, y: 20, width: 60, height: 60,\n      fill: \"rgba(0,255,0,0.5)\", draggable: true\n    });\n    layer.add(rect);\n    layer.draw();\n  };\n\n  const saveMap = () => {\n    const json = stageRef.current.toJSON();\n    const newMap = { id: editing?.id ?? Date.now().toString(), name, json };\n    setMaps(prev => {\n      const exists = prev.some(m => m.id === newMap.id);\n      return exists ? prev.map(m => (m.id === newMap.id ? newMap : m)) : [...prev, newMap];\n    });\n    alert(\"Mapa guardado\");\n    navigate(\"/maps\");\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"container\">\n      <h2>{editing ? \"Editar mapa\" : \"Nuevo mapa\"}</h2>\n      <div className=\"mb-2\">\n        <label className=\"form-label\">Nombre</label>\n        <input className=\"form-control\" value={name} onChange={e => setName(e.target.value)}/>\n      </div>\n\n      <button className=\"btn btn-primary mb-2\" onClick={addRect}>Añadir rectángulo</button>\n\n      <div className=\"border mb-3\" style={{ width: 500, height: 300 }}>\n        <Stage width={500} height={300} ref={stageRef}>\n          <Layer />\n        </Stage>\n      </div>\n\n      <div className=\"d-flex\">\n        <button className=\"btn btn-success me-2\" onClick={saveMap}>Guardar</button>\n        <button className=\"btn btn-secondary\" onClick={() => navigate(\"/maps\")}>Cancelar</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### 8️⃣ `src/utils/storage.js`\n\n📄 [src/utils/storage.js](file:///C:/Users/jairo/.gemini/antigravity/brain/b91b810e-928c-493c-ba7f-da11b9e7b0b1/src/utils/storage.js)\n\n```js\n/* src/utils/storage.js */\nconst CHAR_KEY = \"ttrpg_one_shot_v2\";\nconst MAP_KEY = \"ttrpg_maps_v2\";\n\nexport function loadChars() {\n  const raw = localStorage.getItem(CHAR_KEY);\n  if (!raw) return [];\n  try { return JSON.parse(raw); } catch { return []; }\n}\n\nexport function saveChars(chars) {\n  localStorage.setItem(CHAR_KEY, JSON.stringify(chars));\n}\n\nexport function loadMaps() {\n  const raw = localStorage.getItem(MAP_KEY);\n  if (!raw) return [];\n  try { return JSON.parse(raw); } catch { return []; }\n}\n\nexport function saveMaps(maps) {\n  localStorage.setItem(MAP_KEY, JSON.stringify(maps));\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### 9️⃣ `src/utils/crypto.js`\n\n📄 [src/utils/crypto.js](file:///C:/Users/jairo/.gemini/antigravity/brain/b91b810e-928c-493c-ba7f-da11b9e7b0b1/src/utils/crypto.js)\n\n```js\n/* src/utils/crypto.js */\n// Simple Base64 encoding/decoding (no LZ‑String for brevity)\n\nexport const compress = (obj, hideSecret = false) => {\n  const payload = hideSecret ? { ...obj, secret: undefined } : obj;\n  return btoa(JSON.stringify(payload));\n};\n\nexport const decompress = (b64) => JSON.parse(atob(b64));\n```\n\n---\n\n## ✅ Qué tienes ahora\n\n- **Root HTML** loads Bootstrap, React, React‑DOM, Babel, and React‑Router.  \n- **React app** (`App.jsx`) handles routing, GM flag, persistence, and URL‑based character import.  \n- **Navigation bar** uses Bootstrap and router navigation, eliminating the previous mismatched `setView` issue.  \n- **Character CRUD** with Base64 share links.  \n- **Map list & editor** (Konva canvas) with export/import via Base64.  \n- **Utility modules** (`storage.js`, `crypto.js`) centralize local‑storage handling.  \n\n---\n\n### Next Steps for you\n\n1. **Run locally** → open `index.html` in a browser (or `python -m http.server` from the artifact folder).  \n2. **Test**:  \n   - Create a character, share the link, reload with `?char=…` and verify import.  \n   - Open “Crear mapa”, add a rectangle, save, then view it in the map list.  \n3. **Deploy** to GitHub Pages: push this folder to a `gh‑pages` branch and enable Pages in the repo settings.  \n\nIf you need any additional feature (e.g., integration with a free map‑tile API, richer GM permissions, or a build pipeline), just let me know and I’ll add it.","thinking":"Now need to create remaining files: src/App.jsx, NavBar.jsx, CharList.jsx, CharForm.jsx, MapList.jsx, MapEditor.jsx, utils/storage.js, utils/crypto.js. Provide artifacts."}
